MLDLC-> machine learning development life cycle 

1: frame the problem (see what you want to solve) 
2: Gathering Data  (csv, api , web scraping)
3: Data Preprocessing
----------> remove duplicate
----------> remove mispelled, etc 

4: Exloratory Data analysis
---> do experiment with data and you do graph plot with data and check what you want 
---> outlier detection
---> imbalace dataset

5: Feature Engineering and selection (important)
---> where you create new feature like you merge some column
---> you have to select good feature and remove bad feature 

6: Model Training, Evaluation and Selection
--->you have to train the model with all method and see which method is best
---> Ensemble learning: you have multiple model and you just add all of them 
to get a better result

7: Model Deployment
---> you deploy your model for the users

8: Testing
---> You first send your product to  trusted customer to get good feedback
and then you do the optimize

